## Troubleshooting
### "Failed to connect"
Gateway not running. Start it:
```bash
bun scripts/run-node.mjs gateway
```
### No response
Check configuration:
```bash
cat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json | grep -A 5 '"agents"'
```
### Provider errors
Verify authentication:
```bash
bun scripts/run-node.mjs configure
```
